{"id":"600870","name":"快手煮米粉","author":"苇儿WR","authorId":"9963749","desc":"","cover":"images/600870/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"熟米粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"}],"sub":[{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"大蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"紫甘蓝","amount":"1片"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/600870/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"配菜洗净切好，鸡蛋磕入碗中。","img":"images/600870/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"热锅放少许油，煎熟鸡蛋。","img":"images/600870/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用锅内的底油炒香蒜末。","img":"images/600870/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅内放入一碗开水，稍煮一分钟。","img":"images/600870/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入米粉。","img":"images/600870/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入紫甘蓝丝，调入适量食盐。","img":"images/600870/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入香葱末，再放点芝麻油增香","img":"images/600870/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品，拌匀后开吃。","img":"images/600870/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}